{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your best friend falls into trouble, it\u2019s up to you to embark on a daring journey through the <strong>Land of Letters</strong>. <br><br>In <i>A Difficult Game About Letters</i>, you take control of a character who can transform into any letter of the alphabet. Each letter's shape provides unique abilities, which you\u2019ll need to solve puzzles, navigate obstacles, and complete challenging platforming levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what you can do in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Into Letters</strong>: Instantly switch between 26 different letters to adapt to obstacles. Each letter's shape can help you in unique ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Across Platforms</strong>: Use letters like <strong>J</strong> or <strong>V</strong> to jump higher or leap across wide gaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hook and Grab</strong>: Turn into <strong>L</strong> or <strong>T</strong> to hook onto ledges, edges, or moving platforms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/8cb424ba1fb2d05e8573f99c2c62637e.poster.avif?t=1761126739\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/8cb424ba1fb2d05e8573f99c2c62637e.webm?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/8cb424ba1fb2d05e8573f99c2c62637e.mp4?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll and Squeeze</strong>: Transform into round letters like <strong>O</strong> or <strong>C</strong> to roll through tight spaces or under obstacles.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/7b8656f3f5c080bb61f312330c87b311.poster.avif?t=1761126739\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/7b8656f3f5c080bb61f312330c87b311.webm?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/7b8656f3f5c080bb61f312330c87b311.mp4?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brace and Balance</strong>: Use sturdy letters like <strong>X</strong> or <strong>H</strong> to block moving walls, balance on narrow platforms</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/746c8a7027416c35221672d4340aee65.poster.avif?t=1761126739\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/746c8a7027416c35221672d4340aee65.webm?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/746c8a7027416c35221672d4340aee65.mp4?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a playground of letters and shapes, requiring you to think creatively, experiment with transformations, and master precise movements to progress. With endless possibilities for how to use the alphabet, each challenge feels fresh and rewarding.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440890?t=1761126739","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440890?t=1761126739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/69dd9d2f4dfe70ca604cf0b9e6421d8e69547cad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761126739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/69dd9d2f4dfe70ca604cf0b9e6421d8e69547cad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761126739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3523220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your best friend falls into trouble, it\u2019s up to you to embark on a daring journey through the <strong>Land of Letters</strong>. <br><br>In <i>A Difficult Game About Letters</i>, you take control of a character who can transform into any letter of the alphabet. Each letter's shape provides unique abilities, which you\u2019ll need to solve puzzles, navigate obstacles, and complete challenging platforming levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what you can do in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Into Letters</strong>: Instantly switch between 26 different letters to adapt to obstacles. Each letter's shape can help you in unique ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Across Platforms</strong>: Use letters like <strong>J</strong> or <strong>V</strong> to jump higher or leap across wide gaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hook and Grab</strong>: Turn into <strong>L</strong> or <strong>T</strong> to hook onto ledges, edges, or moving platforms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/8cb424ba1fb2d05e8573f99c2c62637e.poster.avif?t=1761126739\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/8cb424ba1fb2d05e8573f99c2c62637e.webm?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/8cb424ba1fb2d05e8573f99c2c62637e.mp4?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll and Squeeze</strong>: Transform into round letters like <strong>O</strong> or <strong>C</strong> to roll through tight spaces or under obstacles.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/7b8656f3f5c080bb61f312330c87b311.poster.avif?t=1761126739\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/7b8656f3f5c080bb61f312330c87b311.webm?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440890/extras/7b8656f3f5c080bb61f312330c87b311.mp4?t=1761126739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brace and Balance</strong